- Editor world (`/Game/Template/Empty`): closed 4-point edited spline, `User.SpawnPolygon` count 32, distance samples match within `5.83e-05` cm. Sampled curve bounds `X -446.62..1236.49`, `Y -1073.31..809.26`, versus control-point bounds `X -280..1120`, `Y -1050..640` — confirms the real curve, not the control-point quad, is transferred.
- SIE runtime: V8 active, array count 32, all samples matched the runtime spline. SIE was stopped after the gate; the Empty map remains dirty/unsaved by policy.
- The repeated `Accessed None` capsule warning in this Empty-map SIE is the already-restored original character path encountering the map's capsule-less SpectatorPawn; it is unrelated to spline spawning and was intentionally left untouched under the scope lock.

