|---|---|---|
| Scratch graph structure | Exactly one `SP_DriftBob_Velocity` Custom HLSL node; seven inputs (`Map`, `InitialPosition`, existing height/polygon inputs, and the two new offsets); old Custom node count 0; all pins singly linked | PASS |
| Stack overrides | Existing SpawnPolygon/SpawnHeightMin/SpawnHeightMax User links preserved; InitialPosition -> `Particles.Initial.Position`; both offset inputs -> matching `User.*` parameters | PASS |
| Ghost/default audit | DriftBob Custom node count 1, stale old node count 0, matching RapidIteration parameter count 0 | PASS |
| Compile | Forced compile produced outstanding work and completed; GPU script `NCS_UpToDate`, GPU ready, 0 errors, 0 warnings. Mutation compile logged 0.980798 seconds | PASS |
