| Blueprint topology | Same Reader/Index pair; Velocity read; auto-activate false; IsValid -> SetVariableVec3 -> Activate ordering | PASS |
| Compile | Burst and BP both up to date with 0 errors / 0 warnings | PASS |
| Direct zero/nonzero runtime | With SourceVelocity `(600,0,0)`, Burst bounds-center X offsets were 77.8008/155.6016/233.4023 cm at 0.125/0.25/0.375 s; the zero-input control was 1.0149/2.0298/3.0447 cm | PASS |
| Actual NDC path | Main total-spawned 96 -> 106 inferred ten droplet deaths; the same interval observed ten distinct active Burst components, and quiet state returned to 96 live with zero Burst components remaining | PASS |
| Runtime logs | Dedicated direct-probe and actual-path slices both had 0 Blueprint/Niagara/PIE/runtime error or warning hits | PASS |
